        <headline>Small Craft Advisory issued September 24 at 2:21PM PDT until September 26 at 9:00AM PDT by NWS San Francisco CA</headline>
        <description>* WHAT...Northwest winds 10 to 20 kt with gusts up to 30 kt
expected.

* WHERE...Coastal Waters from Point Reyes to Pigeon Point
California out to 10 NM.

* WHEN...From 9 AM Friday to 9 AM PDT Saturday.

* IMPACTS...Conditions will be hazardous to small craft.
</description>
        <instruction>Inexperienced mariners, especially those operating smaller
vessels, should avoid navigating in hazardous conditions.</instruction>
